OL,3,AMeta agrees to pay up to $18bn to
OL,4,Asettle social media case
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media giant Meta has reached a
OL,7,Fsettlement with US states and
OL,8,Fterritories to resolve a court case
OL,9,Frelated to child safety on Facebook and
OL,10,FInstagram.
OL,12,FThe tech company says it will pay a
OL,13,Fmaximum of $18bn (#13.3bn) to 48
OL,14,Fstates, plus the District of Columbia
OL,15,Fand three US territories.
OL,17,FThe settlement requires Meta to
OL,18,Fintroduce certain rules for teenage
OL,19,Fusers, including daily limits and
OL,20,Fnight-time blocks.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
