OL,3,ARocky Horror star Tim Curry dies at 80
OL,4,
OL,5,FHis other films included Annie, The
OL,6,FHunt for Red October and Home Alone 2,
OL,7,Fand he was nominated for three Tony
OL,8,FAwards on Broadway.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
